# Contact Form Email Dispatch Configuration
# To receive emails directly at aaryanpandey28@gmail.com, choose any option:

# Option 1: Web3Forms (Recommended - Free, No backend needed)
# Get a free key at https://web3forms.com
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here

# Option 2: Formspree
# Get a free form ID at https://formspree.io
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=your_formspree_id

# Option 3: Custom Webhook or Firebase Function Endpoint
# VITE_CONTACT_API_URL=https://your-cloud-function-or-api-url.com/contact
